WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:02.661
The federal requirement, from NIST special

2
00:00:02.661 --> 00:00:05.925
publication eight hundred
fifty-three, revision five.

3
00:00:05.925 --> 00:00:11.728
The decision supports P L two, S A nine
and C A three: each function decided and

4
00:00:11.728 --> 00:00:18.187
approved, with its availability, license,
compensating controls and exit criteria.

5
00:00:18.187 --> 00:00:22.038
A decision record isn't mapped
to a key security indicator.

6
00:00:22.038 --> 00:00:27.853
The architecture supports S C seven, A C
four, C M two and C M eight: boundaries,

7
00:00:27.853 --> 00:00:31.190
planes and flows documented and exported,

8
00:00:31.190 --> 00:00:34.813
lined up with two fed-ramp
twenty X indicators.

9
00:00:34.813 --> 00:00:39.430
And the telemetry supports A U two,
A U six, A U twelve and S I four:

10
00:00:39.430 --> 00:00:45.525
the network logs exported and fresh,
lined up with three monitoring indicators.

11
00:00:45.525 --> 00:00:50.849
The evidence supports the controls; your
organization still sets their parameters

12
00:00:50.849 --> 00:00:55.390
and owns the policy, and the assessor
decides whether each is satisfied.
